# Optional — only needed to run `bun run translate`.
#
# Languine (https://languine.ai) machine-translates the source dictionary into
# the target locales declared in `languine.json` (source `en` → `es`, `pt`),
# writing back to `dictionaries/<locale>.json`.
#
# Nothing at runtime reads this: the app loads the committed JSON dictionaries.
# Leave it empty unless you are regenerating translations, and edit the target
# dictionaries by hand if you would rather not use the service at all.
LANGUINE_PROJECT_ID=""
